     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts FRAdverseDrugReactionLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"FRAdverseDrugReactionLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"hcFRAdverseDrugReactionLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Groupe 1 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-adverse-drug-reaction</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-cda-effet-indesirable</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMAdverseDrugReaction</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAEffetIndesirable</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMAdverseDrugReaction.header.identifier</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAEffetIndesirable.id</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMAdverseDrugReaction.header.status</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAEffetIndesirable.statusCode</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMAdverseDrugReaction.adverseDrugReactionType</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAEffetIndesirable.code</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMAdverseDrugReaction.header.date</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAEffetIndesirable.effectiveTime</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMAdverseDrugReaction.detected</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">La date de détection de l'effet indésirable n'est pas mappée dans le profil CDA FRCDAEffetIndesirable. Elle est mappée dans le profil FHIR FRAdverseEventDocument.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMAdverseDrugReaction.value</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAEffetIndesirable.value</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMAdverseDrugReaction.medicationAdministration</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAEffetIndesirable.entryRelationship:frTraitement</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMAdverseDrugReaction.reaction</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAEffetIndesirable.entryRelationship:frProbleme</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMAdverseDrugReaction.causalityAssessment</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAEffetIndesirable.entryRelationship:frImputabiliteEffetIndesirable</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMAdverseDrugReaction.severity</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAEffetIndesirable.entryRelationship:frGraviteEffetIndesirable</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMAdverseDrugReaction.outcome</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAEffetIndesirable.entryRelationship:frEvolutionEffetIndesirable</td><td/></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 2 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-adverse-drug-reaction</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/docum